    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nīmo gwa Bakohati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna hangī ū SEEBA ūbawīla a ba Musa nū Alooni gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū mu lūganda lwa Balawī babalagi a Bakohati, būlī ng'wene mu numba ya ng'wawe, gīt'ūmo jilī numba ja bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubabale pye a bagosha kwandīja ba myaka makūmi adatū, kūshisha ba myaka makūmi atanò abo bakatūmamaga ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīmo gwa Bakohati ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, gūkūbiza kūshilang'hana ī shikolo īsho shilī sheela no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lya kūsaamiwa ī ng'hambī ūlū lyūshika, ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe bakwingīla mo kūlyīnja ī litundubaalī lya hisenge, būlīkundīkīja a h'isandīko lya būkaanīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būlīkundīkīja na makūnza ga mbūli, hanuma būlīkundīkīja hangī na ng'wenda gwa langi ya būlulu. Ūlū būmala ī gīko būlītūūlīla ī mitī yalyo ya kūlībūūkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha meeza ya migatī ya kwizūkīja bakwamba ng'wenda gwa būlulu, būgatūūla ho a masahani, nī shijiiko na a mabbakuli, nī shikombe īsho shikatūmamīlagwa mu kūfunya shakwinha sha kūng'wiwa. Ū ngatī ūyo gūkikalaga ho būl'ikanza bakūgūleka gwikale ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī shikolo shenīsho bakūshikumba ng'wenda gwaza; a higūlya ya ng'wenda būkundīkīja makūnza ga mbūli, hūna bīītūūla ho nī mitī ya kwībūūkīja ī meza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūsola ng'wenda gwa langi ya būlulu būlīkumba ī likīndīkīlo lya tala, hamò nī tala jalyo ījo jikenhaga isana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Isana:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū būūpe ūbo būkīnjaga giiti mu hanhū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na a majimījo ga tala, nī sahani jaho na a mabīīkīlo ga maguta ga kūjibakīja ī tala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ī likīndīkīlo lya tala hamò nī shikolo shalyo bakūlīlingīīla ng'wikundīkījo lya makūnza ga mbūli, hūna būlītūūla hibūkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya ng'walīlo gwa zahabu bakwamba ho ng'wenda gwa būlulu, hūna būgūkumba na makūnza ga mbūli, hama būgūtūūlīla nī mitī ya kūgūbūkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseme īsho shikatūmamīlagwa kū milīmo ya ng'wipandī lyeela bakūshisola ī shose, būshikumba ng'wenda gwa būlulu, hama būshikumba na makūnza ga mbūli, būshitūūla hibūūkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabu ga ha ng'walīlo gwa shaba bakūgīnja hūna bamba ho ng'wenda gwa langi ya nzulunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya yago būshitūūla pyī ī shikolo īsho shikatūmamīlagwa kū milīmo ya ha ng'walīlo gwenūyo, a maahulīlo ga moto, uuma ja kūzubūlīla nyama, makolelo na a mabbakuli ga kūseeseebela mininga; hūna būtūūla ho n'ikundīkījo lya makūnza ga mbūli; hanuma būgūtūūlīla nī mitī ya kūgūbūkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe ūlū būmala maja ū kūshikundīkīja ī shiseme sheela, nī shikolo ī shingī pye, ūlū lyūshika ī likanza lya kwīsaamya ī ng'hambī, a Bakohati nabo hū bakwiza bagwīte ū nīmo gwa kūbūūcha. Gwike yaya ū kūgima kūshikuumya ī shikolo ī sheela; nguno ūlū bīīta gīko bakūcha. Na lūūlū a Bakohati bakūshibūūcha ī shikolo sha ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Elieza ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa ngabīji Alooni akūgalang'hana a maguta ga kūbakīja tala nū būbbani wa ng'waso gwawiza, nū būsu ūbo būkafunyiwagwa būlī lūshikū kūbiza shakwinha sha būsu, na a maguta ga kwitīīlwa batūmami ūlū balītūūlwa ha nīmo. Ū ng'wenūyo h'akūbiza nang'hani walyo pyī ī liheema nī shikolo shalyo shose, nī shitūmamīlo shalyo ī sheela, nī shiseme ī shingī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūbakomeleja a ba Musa nū Alooni alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lang'hanagi gete, ī kaya ja mu numba ya ng'wa Kohati jitizūshila kūjimīīla ū mu lūganda lwa Balawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bilang'hanage bikale bapanga, batizūūcha kūlwa kūsheegeela ī shikolo ī sheela no no no. Na lūūlū ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe bakūyūbagunanha mu gīkī, bakūyingīla ū ng'wipandī lyeela, babahelela būlī ng'wene nīmo gwakwe, nī shikolo īsho shing'wigelilwe kūshibūūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a boi a Bakohati batī ba kūja mo ū mu gatī gīkī bakashilole ī shikolo ī sheela, yaya nūūlū hado dūhū; nguno numho bakūcha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nīmo gwa Bagelishomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla hangī ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Babalage na a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Gelishomu, būlī bene mu kaya jabo, gīt'ūmo jilī kaya ja bakūlūgenja babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babalage pye a bagosha kwandīja ba myaka makūmi adatū kūshisha ba myaka makūmi atanò, abo bakatūmamaga ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba numba ya ng'wa Gelishomu, ū mu katūmamīle kabo ka kūbūūcha miligo, ī milīmo yabo īkūbiza īyī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūbiza babūūcha baago a matundubaalī g'iheema, na a g'ipandī lya kwibilingīla, hamò nī likundīkījo lyalyo lya myenda, ī lya kūtonja, nī lya makūnza ga mbūli īlo līkizaga higūlya; na a matundubaalī ga ha nyango gwa ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a matundubaali ga ha lūūba lwa ha gwalugwa īyo īpīndīlīgije iheema hamò na ng'walīlo. H'a babūūcha baago na a matundubaalī ga ha nyango, nī ngoye; nī shikolo ī shingī pyī īsho shikatūmamīlagwa kūbeeja milīmo yamo. A banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Gelishomu shibigelile kūshitūmamīla ī shikolo shenīshi ū mu kwīyīīta pyī īyo īlagīlilwe kwītwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye ū būtūmami wabo bakūwīta gīt'ūmo kalī katongeelele ka ng'wa Alooni na bitūnja bakwe; ni gūbizage nīmo gwa kūbūūcha nūūlū gwa kūbeeja shikolo shose shose. Ūkūbahelela bebe īsho bakūyūshibūūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
